# Spike 22f demo, played: after the title card, select the commander,
# drag out a block of generators, then shift-queue a move and a fight.
# Its path runs through every order, the sites show as ghosts, and its
# info pane lists what it's doing and what's next.
at 3.5 drag 450,200 1150,700            # the headquarters and the commander
at 3.8 click 60,710                     # the commander's tile: only it
at 4.0 expect selected == 1
at 4.4 key Z
at 4.6 key W                            # a generator
at 5.0 press 760,560
at 5.4 move 800,580
at 5.8 move 820,600
at 6.2 release 820,600
at 6.6 key M
at 7.0 click 1000,500 shift             # then move
at 7.2 key Escape
at 7.4 key G
at 7.8 click 1050,350 shift             # then fight
at 8.0 key Escape
at 8.6 expect sent build >= 6
at 9.0 shot planned
at 16.0 shot building
at 24.0 shot later
at 25.0 quit
